# Deny by default: nothing at the top level is tracked unless it's un-ignored
# here. Add a line for each Stow package as it moves in (e.g. `!/nvim/`), so a
# stray file or a whole folder Stow absorbed can't slip into a commit.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitleaks.toml
!/README.md
!/hooks/
!/ghostty/
!/nvim/
!/bin/
!/tmux/
!/zsh/
!/git/
!/term/
!/aerospace/
!/misc/
!/macos/
!/blink/

# Never tracked, even inside an un-ignored package. These come last so no
# package line above can re-include them (the last matching rule wins).
**/.credentials.json
**/.claude.json
**/auth.json
**/hosts.yml
**/ngrok.yml
**/.ssh/
**/atuin/key
**/raycast/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.sqlite*
**/history.jsonl
.DS_Store
